-- Build-time code generation demo (docs/COMPUTE.md 4.1): prints a Luau module
-- holding the row kernel of Expr.demo(16, 1024, 11), compiled to straight-line
-- source. The output is committed as bench/generated/ExprDemoRow.luau and
-- required by bench/compute.luau and tests/compute.test.luau, which check it
-- against the op-array interpreter bit for bit.
--
-- usage: luau tools/gen_expr.luau > bench/generated/ExprDemoRow.luau
local Expr = require("../src/compute/Expr")
local prog = Expr.compile(Expr.demo(16, 1024, 11))
print("--!native")
print("--!optimize 2")
print("-- GENERATED by tools/gen_expr.luau from Expr.demo(16, 1024, 11). Do not edit.")
print(Expr.sourceRow(prog))
